        "slot": "P",
        "id": "TeemoPassive",
        "name": "Guerrilla Warfare",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "If Teemo stands still and takes no actions for a short duration, he becomes Invisible indefinitely. If he's in brush, Teemo can enter and maintain his Invisibility while moving. After leaving Invisibility, Teemo gains the Element of Surprise, increasing his Attack Speed for a few seconds.",
        "bodyHtml": "If Teemo stands still for 1.5 seconds without being damaged, he becomes <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisible</span> until he moves. While in a brush, he can maintain <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisibility</span> while moving.<br /><br />Upon exiting this <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">Invisibility</span>, Teemo gains <span>80% Attack Speed</span> for 5 seconds.",
