        "name": "Move Quick",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Teemo scampers around, passively increasing his Move Speed until he is struck by an enemy champion or turret. Teemo can sprint to gain bonus Move Speed that isn't stopped by being struck for a short time.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Teemo gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">12/16/20/24/28% Move Speed</span> while he hasn't been damaged by a champion or turret in the last 5 seconds.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Teemo sprints, gaining <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">24/32/40/48/56% Move Speed</span> that is not lost when struck for 3 seconds.",
